  ProjectName: Brand Activation
  ClientName: Sabseg
  Tags: 34
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Intern Developer.
  - category: 1
    info: 'SABSEG is an insurance broker that sponsors several clubs in Portugal''s
      first and second football divisions. For its Celebrate Football initiative,
      hivolve created a VR brand activation that ran in the stadiums of the sponsored
      clubs.

      

'
  - category: 2
    info: 'A VR penalty-saving game. The player is the goalkeeper and tries to stop
      penalties, with a reward for each save. We built several football stadiums,
      different player scenarios and dynamic weather conditions.

      

'
  - category: 3
    info: As my initial venture into VR development, the most significant challenge
      revolved around grasping the workings of VR components.
  - category: 9
    info: '- This was my first VR project. I got up to speed with SteamVR by studying
      its documentation and taking apart its example scenes.

      - Used that
      knowledge to build the VR goalkeeping gameplay on top of the plugin.'
